Backport of tenstorrent/tt-metal#55638.

The B2D path of eltwise_unary_configure_mop clears one SrcB DVALID per outer
iteration but hardcodes four of them, while tenstorrent/tt-metal#52256 made the
Blackhole ROW-broadcast unpacker publish one face per tile face. A tile with
fewer than four faces (a 16x32 tile has two) leaves math waiting on
publications that never arrive, hanging the device. Remove this patch once
TT_METAL_TAG names a tt-metal that contains tenstorrent/tt-metal#55638.

